# Files that live in this repository but are not part of the website.
#
# Cloudflare Pages publishes the whole repository (there is no build step),
# so without these lines anyone could open the booking server's code, the
# setup notes and the admin scripts at their normal paths. None of them hold
# secrets, but together they map out how the site works, which saves an
# automated attack tool a lot of exploring.
#
# Pages follows a redirect even when a file exists at that path, so the file
# itself is never sent. _redirects cannot return 404 directly (it only
# supports 301, 302, 303, 307 and 308), so each request goes to the
# "page not found" page instead. 302, not 301, so browsers do not remember
# it and a rule can be removed cleanly later.
#
# Keep this list in step with any new non-website folder or file.

/firestore.rules  /404  302
/storage.rules    /404  302
/.gitignore       /404  302
/server/*         /404  302
/scripts/*        /404  302
/docs/*           /404  302
/.github/*        /404  302
/.claude/*        /404  302
